<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-22T08:19:02.412Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:19:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The RSF imposed a night curfew in Sennar as fighting intensified in the Blue Nile, while drone strikes hit aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. RSF forces moved toward Ed Damazin, prompting Burhan to reassure residents, and a protester was killed during a demonstration in Darfur. Most charity kitchens in Khartoum have shut, leaving many facing starvation, and a Christian girl was killed by her brother while trying to escape a forced marriage. The conflict resulted in 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/features/2026/11/22/displaced-from-darfur-sudan-families-face-volatile-winter-as-aid-cuts-loom?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/90cec5dc-f699-4966-886d-6277cc289ed0?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQd3h1X1JTRUM4RmNIMVFhdlFsR0JHWlpTZk95TkxVd0ZmMkdKMUc5OFV5MU0zZDNCTDFZbEctdVB3WThpSW95YmZSY3FsLXVLVWdMTnoyZlVtSGgzTHM3WUc5NmFhMVh4a3BDSzl3S0FwZy1WSHp4aGcyYWJfMkpGM3JBODl6NjBqbGpPeG1KNWZ2V09JZjhhMkpuMU5PSUNBamItYVdlbThtSGdFQ2ZNWGt3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Tamil Guardian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
